What Was Causing the Issue
The delete icon next to Offline previously relied on the browser's native window.confirm() popup dialog. In sandboxed iframe environments (such as the AI Studio preview), native dialog calls like window.confirm and window.alert are blocked by default and immediately return false without displaying anything, which prevented the delete handler from ever executing. Additionally, the button was conditionally gated behind strict admin credentials.
